{
  "sections": {
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "vendor": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "{{ product.vendor }}",
            "text_style": "uppercase"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title"
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price"
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_shape": "circle"
          }
        },
        "quantity_selector": {
          "type": "quantity_selector"
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_dynamic_checkout": true,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": true
          }
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description"
        },
        "share": {
          "type": "share",
          "settings": {
            "share_label": "Share"
          }
        },
        "ship": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Delivery",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>A lift ships as one crate, roughly 12 feet long and 1,600 lb, by LTL freight. Business with a forklift: freight included on Forward, flat zone rate on AMGO. Home driveway: liftgate truck, +$225 — the driver sets the crate on the ground; it does not go inside. Free pickup in Sussex, WI. The carrier calls ahead for a weekday window and someone has to be there. Count the pieces and photograph any damage before you sign the receipt; do that and the claim is ours to handle.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "warranty": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warranty & returns",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Manufacturer warranty as published for this model (AMGO: 5-year structural, 3-year hydraulic, 2-year electrical; Forward: published structural and parts terms). Parts only; labor not covered. Contact us first and we open the claim with the manufacturer. Because equipment ships by freight, returns are accepted for defective or incorrectly shipped items; refused or returned shipments in good condition are subject to round-trip freight and a restocking fee.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "install": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Installation & what you need",
            "icon": "box",
            "content": "<p>Installation isn't included. Before you order, confirm ceiling height, concrete (most two-post lifts call for 4\\\" of 3,000-psi concrete, cured 28 days — see the manual for this model), and power (most need a 220V single-phase circuit). We bolted down our own and can tell you what it takes, or put you in touch with an installer in southeast Wisconsin.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "title",
        "price",
        "variant_picker",
        "quantity_selector",
        "buy_buttons",
        "description",
        "ship",
        "warranty",
        "install",
        "share"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "enable_sticky_info": true,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "media_position": "left",
        "gallery_layout": "stacked",
        "media_size": "medium",
        "constrain_to_viewport": true,
        "media_fit": "contain",
        "image_zoom": "lightbox",
        "mobile_thumbnails": "hide",
        "hide_variants": true,
        "enable_video_looping": false,
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 12
      }
    },
    "disclosures": {
      "type": "disclosures",
      "settings": {
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "related-products": {
      "type": "related-products",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "You may also like",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "products_to_show": 4,
        "columns_desktop": 4,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "image_ratio": "square",
        "image_shape": "default",
        "show_secondary_image": true,
        "show_vendor": false,
        "show_rating": false,
        "columns_mobile": "2",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 28
      }
    },
    "related": {
      "type": "related-products",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Pairs with",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "products_to_show": 4,
        "columns_desktop": 4,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "show_secondary_image": false,
        "show_vendor": false,
        "show_rating": false,
        "columns_mobile": "2",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 28
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "main",
    "related"
  ]
}
